&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;14,681&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;44,091&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AnnexedDetailedScheduleOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AnnexedDetailedScheduleOfProvisionsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:36pt;"&gt;【引当金明細表】&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AnnexedDetailedScheduleOfProvisionsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:ComponentsOfMajorAssetsAndLiabilitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
(2) 【主な資産及び負債の内容】連結財務諸表を作成しているため、記載を省略しています。 </jpcrp_cor:ComponentsOfMajorAssetsAndLiabilitiesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:OtherInformationFinancialStatementsEtcTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(3) 【その他】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OtherInformationFinancialStatementsEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:OverviewOfOperationalProceduresForSharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
